Defects found in alpha2
-----------------------
1. C:Regex applied LIMIT before regcomp(), when regex_t was not yet valid, and
   ignored the failed regsetmatchlimit() result. Low-limit cases therefore
   behaved as ordinary no-match (RC5).
2. After fixing the ordering, regex.library correctly returned REG_ESPACE on
   match-limit exhaustion, but C:Regex treated only REG_BADPAT as a match
   error. It again converted limit exhaustion to RC5.

