Release gate
------------
The alpha2 release must remain a prerelease and must not be promoted to RC:
its published C:Regex contains both LIMIT defects above. Current main fixes
them, but still requires a new candidate package and qualification.

Still open before an RC claim:
- deterministic allocator-failure injection and recovery
- full upstream PCRE2 regression suite
- real classic 68040 hardware
- AROS compatibility
- complete interactive Workbench Installer validation of the replacement package
